                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Agho Musengwa Katonda yaayogera ninze, yankoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe omuntu, amaiso go galingirize Abammoni, olange akabi akali kubaidhira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koba Abammoni bawulire nze Musengwa Katonda bye ndi kubakoba nti: Imwe mwasanhuka mwakoba muti, ‘Otyo, kirongoolo,’ eisinzizo lyange lwe baalyonoona, ensi Isiraeli ni bagizikiriza, n'Abayudaaya ni babatwala mu bunhage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni ndibaghaayo mu ngalo edh'abantu ab'e buvandhuba baabaghangula, baasimba weema dhaibwe mu nsi yaimwe baagibaamu. Baliryanga ebibala era baanhwanga amata ebyandibaire ebyaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndifuula ekibuga Rabba kyaba kyayiro kya ngamiya, ate ebibuga by'omu Ammoni ebindi naabifuula bigo bya ntaama na mbuzi. Olwo mulimanha nga ninze Musengwa Katonda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
